+
+The following instructions are associated with the <%= ext.name %> extension <%- if cfg_arch.fully_configured? -%>and implemented in the <%= cfg_arch.name %> configuration<%- else -%>(their actual implementation depends on the full configuration of <%= cfg_arch.name %>)<%- end -%>:
+
+[cols="1,3"]
+|===
+<%- insts.each do |inst| -%>
+  | <%= "`#{inst.name}`" %> | *<%= inst.long_name %>*
+<%- end -%>
+|===
+<%- end -%>
+
+<%- unless ext.params.empty? -%>
+== Parameters
+
+This extension has the following implementation options:
+
+<%- ext.params.sort_by { |p| p.name }.each do |param| -%>
+<%= param.name %>::
++
+--
+<%= param.desc %>
+--
